# Distribution tier: process.
# The making ships; the products do not. Add a type here when a new renderer appears.
*.html
*.svg
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.pdf

# Vendor libraries and data — a minified js or a stroke-order json is an input, not a
# product: it is re-fetchable and it is not ours to publish. The WORK.md says where from.
*.js
*.json

# The whole products tree stays out of the repository. What ships is the making; §6 of
# each WORK.md says how to regenerate or re-fetch everything under here.
artifacts/

# A work that must ship its product force-adds it (git add -f) and says why in
# its WORK.md §6 — an exception written down, never a silent one.
